## Material 3 Core Principles

- Enable `useMaterial3: true` in ThemeData
- Use Material 3 color roles
- Apply dynamic color when appropriate
- Follow Material 3 typography scale
- Implement proper elevation system
- Use surface tints for elevation
- Support light and dark themes

## Monica Brand Integration

- Primary brand color: `#6366F1` (indigo)
- Use `Color(0xFF6366F1)` constant
- Generate palette with `ColorScheme.fromSeed()`
- Override primary to maintain brand
- Test brand colors in all themes
- Maintain accessibility standards
- Apply brand consistently across components

```dart
// Monica Material 3 theme setup
static const Color _monicaBrandColor = Color(0xFF6366F1);

ThemeData(
  colorScheme: ColorScheme.fromSeed(
    seedColor: _monicaBrandColor,
    brightness: Brightness.light,
  ).copyWith(primary: _monicaBrandColor),
  useMaterial3: true,
)
```

